Package: tivis.r
Title: Read Diaspective Vision TIVITA Hyperspectral Recordings
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("R.", "Heller", email = "raban.heller@uni-ulm.de",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8006-9742"))
Description: Reads hyperspectral imaging data written by the Diaspective
    Vision 'TIVITA Suite', used for intraoperative tissue and perfusion imaging.
    Parses the binary 'SpecCube.dat' container (big-endian float32 samples in
    band-interleaved-by-pixel order behind a 12-byte dimension header), the
    German-language acquisition metadata log, and the parameter images the
    Suite exports alongside each recording (oxygenation, NIR perfusion, tissue
    haemoglobin and water indices). The reader requires no vendor software
    development kit and contains no compiled code. It is a companion to
    'cuvis.r', which covers Cubert snapshot cameras, and a data source for
    'hyperspectR'.
